  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF2-04 Securing a Polynesian Promise for Climate and Community Resilience in Samoa and Tokelau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation International Aotearoa will work with communities and schools&#xA0;across Samoa and Tokelau to implement environmental programmes to foster a new generation of ocean stewardship and climate champions. The Activity will increase understanding of marine ecosystems, climate change threats and mitigations through enhanced understanding and inclusive citizen science, and contribute to implementing ocean and climate policies and improved marine management.</narrative>
  </description>
